    "description": "### Impact\r\nWhen a crafted backup is restored on a site using S3, its upload file names can make Discourse upload files from outside the uploads directory to the bucket, including configuration files. Only sites with `allow_restore` enabled are affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nKeep `allow_restore` disabled, and only restore backups from trusted sources.\r\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerability ANT-2026-4U20ZJW5.",
